# Adding a directory integration (auto-launch)

**Agent:** One PR, [PR checklist](#pr-checklist). Not a social `SocialProvider` — profile in OpenQuok, member submits on the directory site; extension autofills from API `extension_config`. Social posting: **add-social-provider-integration.mdc**. Also **backend-migrations-naming**, **backend-migrations-seed**, **source-project-neutrality**, **company-brand-icons**.

**Deep reference:** `docs/auto-launch/extension-ui-patterns.md` (steps, compare rail, `profilePath` tables, manual smoke).

## Identifier contract

| Concept | Format | Must match in |
| --- | --- | --- |
| **Site slug** | kebab-case (`peerpush`, `open-launch`) | `link_directory_sites.slug`, `buildDirectoryAddChannelTiles`, `/icons/link-directory/{slug}.svg` |
| **Opportunity slug** | per path (`standard-launch`, `free-queue`) | `link_directory_opportunities.slug` (per `site_id`) |
| **Provider slug** | `{site}-{variant}` | `auto_launch_destinations`, `link_directory_opportunities.auto_launch_provider_slug`, `destination-configs/<site>.ts` provider rows + aggregated `directoryLaunchProviders`, content script registration, tests |

Wire: `auto_launch_enabled` + `auto_launch_provider_slug` on opportunity; `auto_launch_destinations.link_directory_opportunity_id` → opportunity. Optional `picker_group_key` / `picker_group_title` for one Add Channel card with variant picker.

## Files to add or modify

### Database (seeds)

| Action | Path | Notes |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Add | `backend/supabase/db/link-directory/504_<date>_seed_<site>.sql` | `link_directory_sites` + `link_directory_opportunities` (`dofollow`, cost, `auto_launch_*`) |
| Add | `backend/supabase/db/auto-launch/503_<date>_seed_<site>_destination.sql` | Destination **rows** only; `extension_config` = `'{}'::jsonb` on insert |
| Regenerate | `backend/supabase/db/auto-launch/505_*_extension_configs.sql` | Via `pnpm sync:auto-launch-configs` — do not hand-edit |
| Run | `pnpm backend:db:aggregate-migrations-all` | Never edit `backend/supabase/migrations/*_core_structure.sql` |

Refs: Uneed `link-directory/502_*` + `auto-launch/502_*`; PeerPush `link-directory/504_*` + `auto-launch/503_*`; Open Launch `link-directory/505_*` + `auto-launch/504_*`. Storage bucket: `auto-launch/502_20261013_seed_uneed_destinations.sql` (reuse unless new bucket).

### `extension_config` (TypeScript → SQL)

| Action | Path |
| --- | --- |
| Add or edit | `common/src/auto-launch/destination-configs/<site>.ts` — `EXTENSION_CONFIG` fixtures (steps, `profilePath`, `fillMode`, `proof`, compare flags), `{SITE}_DIRECTORY_LAUNCH_PROVIDERS` rows (`hostPatterns`, `contentScriptEntry`, `defaultStartUrl`) |
| Edit | `common/src/auto-launch/destination-configs/index.ts` — `DIRECTORY_EXTENSION_CONFIG_FIXTURES`, `DIRECTORY_EXTENSION_CONFIG_PROVIDER_SLUGS` |
| Edit (new site module) | `common/src/auto-launch/destination-configs/directoryLaunchRegistry.ts` — spread the site’s `*_DIRECTORY_LAUNCH_PROVIDERS` into `directoryLaunchProviders` |
| Edit (pricing-first variant) | `common/src/auto-launch/destination-configs/syncMetadata.ts` — `AUTO_LAUNCH_EXTENSION_CONFIG_PRICING_READY_HINT_DERIVED` + explicit TS export with `readyUrlHint: 'pricing'` (no SQL `jsonb_set`) |
| Edit (official tag/category/select catalogs) | `common/src/auto-launch/destination-configs/fieldCatalogRegistry.ts` — register catalog ids + handlers; wire `tagsCatalog` / `checkboxCatalog` / `selectCatalog` on fields in the site fixture |
| Edit | `common/src/auto-launch/destination-configs/destination-configs.test.ts` — provider slug list + registry drift vs fixtures when adding variants |
| Run | `pnpm sync:auto-launch-configs` then aggregate migrations |

`DirectoryLaunchProvider` types and registry helpers are re-exported from `common/src/browser-extension/pageAssist.ts` for backward compatibility — **do not** add inline provider rows there.

New `profilePath` in config → update composer/validation only when members must edit values (prefer existing Discovery dimensions — see **extension-ui-patterns.md**).

