## PR checklist

**Catalog & DB**

- [ ] `link-directory` seed: site + opportunities (`dofollow`, cost, `auto_launch_*`)
- [ ] `auto-launch` host seed: destination rows, FK to opportunity, `'{}'::jsonb` config stub
- [ ] `destination-configs/*.ts` + registry; `pnpm sync:auto-launch-configs`; aggregate migrations

**Extension**

- [ ] `destination-configs` fixtures + `{site}` provider rows + `directoryLaunchRegistry.ts`; content script, `build-extension.mjs`, `manifest.json`
- [ ] `siteLogin` adapter + `detectDirectorySiteLogin.ts`
- [ ] Handoff opens `start_url`; fill + complete on live site

**Web & assets**

- [ ] Logo SVG + `buildDirectoryAddChannelTiles` (+ test)
- [ ] Composer / readiness cover required `profilePath`s

**Docs & marketing**

- [ ] `directory-integration/{site}.md`, `extension-ui-patterns.md` updates
- [ ] Landing/README/docs icon rows when channel is public

**Verification**

- [ ] `pnpm --filter openquok-common test:unit` (includes sync check)
- [ ] Manual smoke per **extension-ui-patterns.md** (update destination count if needed)

## Do not

- Edit aggregated `*_core_structure.sql` or hand-edit `505_*` / inline `$json$` `extension_config`
- Derive free-queue config in SQL with `jsonb_set` — explicit TS fixture
- Register `provider_slug` only in DB without `destination-configs` provider rows + extension manifest/build
- Add inline `directoryLaunchProviders` entries in `pageAssist.ts` (registry lives in `destination-configs/`)
- Confuse **site slug** with **provider slug**
- Add `backend/integrations/providers/*` or social composer tiles for directory-only launches
